{"id":4975,"date":"2025-08-04T11:51:48","date_gmt":"2025-08-04T11:51:48","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4975"},"modified":"2025-08-11T07:23:12","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T07:23:12","slug":"cach-doi-ngay-thang-nam-sinh-tren-tiktok","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/tin-tuc\/cach-doi-ngay-thang-nam-sinh-tren-tiktok\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ed5i ng\u00e0y th\u00e1ng n\u0103m sinh tr\u00ean TikTok si\u00eau \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"ZwnsdY3Tlo2JaQxEQfPlX2eggCf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C1YYd3IHLoPbfcxFsf9lv6vugPe\">Thay \u0111\u1ed5i ng\u00e0y th\u00e1ng n\u0103m sinh tr\u00ean TikTok l\u00e0 thao t\u00e1c t\u01b0\u1edfng ch\u1eebng \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n nh\u01b0ng l\u1ea1i \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng l\u1edbn \u0111\u1ebfn quy\u1ec1n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c t\u00ednh n\u0103ng quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u01b0 livestream, nh\u1eafn tin hay truy c\u1eadp TikTok Shop. V\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n hay th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, n\u1ebfu c\u1ea7n t\u1ed1i \u01b0u to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n t\u1eeb thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, h\u00e3y \u0111\u1ec3 <span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><a style=\"color: #ffcc00;\" href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong><\/a><\/span> \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng t\u1ed1i \u0111a s\u1ee9c m\u1ea1nh TikTok m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KC19ddK43owUH7xzCPAlkfpCgEg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-AVu8dVvlHovCb6xfqxblQJzWgEb\"><strong>1. Gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok?<\/strong><\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4005\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4005\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4005\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24.png\" alt=\"ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng ph\u1ea3i t\u1eeb 13 tu\u1ed5i tr\u1edf l\u00ean m\u1edbi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p t\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n v\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4005\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng ph\u1ea3i t\u1eeb 13 tu\u1ed5i tr\u1edf l\u00ean m\u1edbi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p t\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n v\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C5JydYPxFoDq21xLec9lPyOPgoc\">TikTok quy \u0111\u1ecbnh ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng ph\u1ea3i t\u1eeb 13 tu\u1ed5i tr\u1edf l\u00ean m\u1edbi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p t\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n v\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng. Tuy nhi\u00ean, m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 qu\u1ed1c gia c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n cao h\u01a1n theo lu\u1eadt \u0111\u1ecba ph\u01b0\u01a1ng (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: t\u1ea1i EU l\u00e0 16 tu\u1ed5i n\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 s\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed3ng \u00fd c\u1ee7a ph\u1ee5 huynh).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EcXYdxQjXo5nifx932sltrxSg8g\">Ngo\u00e0i ra, TikTok c\u00f3 c\u00e1c t\u00ednh n\u0103ng ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t \u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i nh\u01b0:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FQU0daftLoqW3YxZSc8lhDungqF\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n d\u01b0\u1edbi 16 tu\u1ed5i m\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ecbnh l\u00e0 ri\u00eang t\u01b0.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EHGvd8Xiuo72zKxF0kVlhDV5gGf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 livestream ho\u1eb7c t\u1eb7ng\/nh\u1eadn qu\u00e0 n\u1ebfu ch\u01b0a \u0111\u1ee7 18 tu\u1ed5i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fc2edgCk4oQxO8xGl0vlJ7pKgte\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 n\u1ed9i dung nh\u1ea1y c\u1ea3m, qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o ho\u1eb7c t\u00ednh n\u0103ng ki\u1ebfm ti\u1ec1n s\u1ebd b\u1ecb gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng nh\u1ecf tu\u1ed5i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U2oFdswUAolG9gxldMdlORjgg1d\">TikTok s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nhi\u1ec1u bi\u1ec7n ph\u00e1p \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e1c minh \u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i, bao g\u1ed3m AI v\u00e0 x\u00e1c minh th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng khi c\u00f3 b\u00e1o c\u00e1o ho\u1eb7c vi ph\u1ea1m.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZFY0daZTdoB166x1olnlNspmgyg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-J9W1dy1QDoF7O7xK9gjlP8CPgio\"><strong>2. Xem th\u00f4ng tin ng\u00e0y th\u00e1ng n\u0103m sinh tr\u00ean TikTok<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OfALdqsQzoi7IcxARGLlOucFgYf\">Hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i TikTok \u0111\u00e3 c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt, v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 xem l\u1ea1i ng\u00e0y th\u00e1ng n\u0103m sinh c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh trong ph\u1ea7n \u201cT\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n\u201d<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SXK7dVpDWoFwjRxi8Uhl2VYSgLh\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1:<\/strong> M\u1edf \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng TikTok tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i \u2192 nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o m\u1ee5c \u201cH\u1ed3 s\u01a1\u201d (bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng g\u00f3c d\u01b0\u1edbi b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SXK7dVpDWoFwjRxi8Uhl2VYSgLh\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2:<\/strong> Nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng ba d\u1ea5u g\u1ea1ch ngang \u1edf g\u00f3c tr\u00ean b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SXK7dVpDWoFwjRxi8Uhl2VYSgLh\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3:<\/strong> Ch\u1ecdn \u201cC\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t v\u00e0 quy\u1ec1n ri\u00eang t\u01b0\u201d \u2192 ch\u1ecdn &#8220;T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n&#8221;.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SXK7dVpDWoFwjRxi8Uhl2VYSgLh\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: <\/strong>Ch\u1ecdn &#8220;Th\u00f4ng tin t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n&#8221;\u00a0 \u2192 m\u1ee5c &#8220;Ng\u00e0y sinh&#8221; s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c hi\u1ec7n ra<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4976\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4976\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4976\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/21.png\" alt=\"Chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1ch xem th\u00f4ng tin ng\u00e0y th\u00e1ng n\u0103m sinh tr\u00ean TikTok\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/21.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/21-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/21-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/21-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/21-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4976\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1ch xem th\u00f4ng tin ng\u00e0y th\u00e1ng n\u0103m sinh tr\u00ean TikTok<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-NRDmd2vAso1dA1xXhEClVxqAgyt\"><strong>3. C\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ed5i ng\u00e0y th\u00e1ng n\u0103m sinh tr\u00ean TikTok<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SsQQdjzKyo3fI4xTjj3lPk1JgSg\">Vi\u1ec7c thay \u0111\u1ed5i ng\u00e0y sinh tr\u00ean TikTok c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1c t\u00ednh n\u0103ng b\u1ea1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, nh\u01b0 livestream hay nh\u1eafn tin.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AuNBdZO7CoJYE0xVSoklYsMegbg\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1:<\/strong> Truy c\u1eadp menu c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t &gt; Ch\u1ecdn \u201cC\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t v\u00e0 quy\u1ec1n ri\u00eang t\u01b0\u201d<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DsUzdI5I2oxSpvxobKmlLYJrgpe\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2:<\/strong> Ch\u1ecdn m\u1ee5c \u201cT\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n\u201d &gt; Nh\u1ea5n ti\u1ebfp v\u00e0o \u201cTh\u00f4ng tin t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n\u201d<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4976\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4976\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4976\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/21.png\" alt=\"C\u00e1ch th\u1ef1c \u0111\u1ed5i ng\u00e0y sinh tr\u00ean TikTok gi\u1ed1ng nh\u01b0 c\u00e1ch xem\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/21.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/21-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/21-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/21-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/21-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4976\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">C\u00e1ch th\u1ef1c \u0111\u1ed5i ng\u00e0y sinh tr\u00ean TikTok gi\u1ed1ng nh\u01b0 c\u00e1ch xem<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"ZwnsdY3Tlo2JaQxEQfPlX2eggCf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GjADdwIvwoxkLzxZhXNldAmTgpe\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3:<\/strong> Nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o d\u00f2ng \u201cNg\u00e0y sinh\u201d &gt; Ch\u1ecdn l\u1ea1i ng\u00e0y, th\u00e1ng, n\u0103m sinh mong mu\u1ed1n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XJTPd23wboi38rxtSU8lrBEfg9c\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 4:<\/strong> Nh\u1ea5n \u201cL\u01b0u\u201d \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn &gt; Ch\u1ecdn \u201cX\u00e1c nh\u1eadn\u201d n\u1ebfu \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c y\u00eau c\u1ea7u x\u00e1c minh<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4977\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4977\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4977\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/22.png\" alt=\"Ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda ng\u00e0y sinh chho ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p, sau \u0111\u00f3 l\u01b0u v\u00e0 x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/22.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/22-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/22-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/22-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/22-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4977\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda ng\u00e0y sinh chho ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p, sau \u0111\u00f3 l\u01b0u v\u00e0 x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"ZwnsdY3Tlo2JaQxEQfPlX2eggCf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DTmWdxX3Moi1Fyxnndxlw9jJgdh\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-IvDFdOWp3otUTxx0fi0lBLTogtd\"><strong>4. Nh\u1eefng l\u01b0u \u00fd khi thay \u0111\u1ed5i ng\u00e0y th\u00e1ng n\u0103m sinh tr\u00ean TikTok<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WVoYdcA44ooBz1xntIjl2iZMg3d\">Vi\u1ec7c thay \u0111\u1ed5i ng\u00e0y th\u00e1ng n\u0103m sinh tr\u00ean TikTok t\u01b0\u1edfng ch\u1eebng \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n nh\u01b0ng l\u1ea1i \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp \u0111\u1ebfn tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng. T\u1eeb quy\u1ec1n truy c\u1eadp c\u00e1c t\u00ednh n\u0103ng \u0111\u1ebfn gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i, m\u1ecdi ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u00e0y sinh \u0111\u1ec1u c\u1ea7n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00e2n nh\u1eafc k\u1ef9 l\u01b0\u1ee1ng. Tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi b\u1ea1n th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n thao t\u00e1c n\u00e0y, h\u00e3y c\u00f9ng t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 l\u01b0u \u00fd quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh g\u1eb7p r\u1eafc r\u1ed1i ho\u1eb7c b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf t\u00ednh n\u0103ng kh\u00f4ng mong mu\u1ed1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J3pvdVvo5oMx0cx9XcFlzcAjgHf\">TikTok kh\u00f4ng cho ph\u00e9p b\u1ea1n thay \u0111\u1ed5i ng\u00e0y sinh nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ea7n li\u00ean ti\u1ebfp. Sau khi \u0111\u00e3 ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd ph\u1ea3i ch\u1edd m\u1ed9t kho\u1ea3ng th\u1eddi gian (c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 v\u00e0i tu\u1ea7n ho\u1eb7c l\u00e2u h\u01a1n) m\u1edbi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ed5i l\u1ea1i. Ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thay \u0111\u1ed5i ng\u00e0y sinh m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 l\u1ea7n gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TPfMdb7eGowznQxblQ9lrqUqgHb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u00f9y v\u00e0o \u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i m\u00e0 TikTok b\u1eadt ho\u1eb7c t\u1eaft m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 t\u00ednh n\u0103ng nh\u01b0:<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IZ6bd9mhIo2mKfxtUuwl7U0Ngzb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u1ea1o livestream<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-THlFdFWAuolAGjxLJ15lfV26gAe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>G\u1eedi ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eadn tin nh\u1eafn tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp (DM)<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XaQKdjBPWoYROnx8dlqlYaG7gXf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>B\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn video<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MELldorHdoopzQxPNnnlX6Nkghe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Truy c\u1eadp TikTok Shop<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4978\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4978\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4978\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/23.png\" alt=\"TikTok hi\u1ec7n kh\u00f4ng cho thay \u0111\u1ed5i ng\u00e0y sinh qu\u00e1 nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ea7n, v\u00ec v\u1eady h\u00e3y c\u00e2n nh\u1eafc thay \u0111\u1ed5i cho ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/23.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/23-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/23-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/23-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/23-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4978\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">TikTok hi\u1ec7n kh\u00f4ng cho thay \u0111\u1ed5i ng\u00e0y sinh qu\u00e1 nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ea7n, v\u00ec v\u1eady h\u00e3y c\u00e2n nh\u1eafc thay \u0111\u1ed5i cho ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HgWWdJThooL8WzxgLK1lUc0MgHb\">N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n nh\u1eadp sai ho\u1eb7c c\u1ed1 t\u00ecnh ch\u1ecdn tu\u1ed5i d\u01b0\u1edbi 18, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u1eefng t\u00ednh n\u0103ng quan tr\u1ecdng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XERidlAbdo5gDbx4mHBl0tYCgyf\">Tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u00e2y TikTok cho ph\u00e9p ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng g\u1eedi bi\u1ec3u m\u1eabu h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ec9nh ng\u00e0y sinh. Tuy nhi\u00ean, hi\u1ec7n nay vi\u1ec7c thay \u0111\u1ed5i ch\u1ec9 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp trong \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng, v\u00e0 m\u1ed7i t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ec9nh m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n trong th\u1eddi gian gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n. Vi\u1ec7c nh\u1eadp sai ng\u00e0y sinh c\u1ed1 t\u00ecnh (\u0111\u1ec3 v\u01b0\u1ee3t gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i) c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 khi\u1ebfn TikTok h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf, kh\u00f3a t\u00ednh n\u0103ng ho\u1eb7c th\u1eadm ch\u00ed kh\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n n\u1ebfu ph\u00e1t hi\u1ec7n vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch. Sau khi \u0111\u1ed5i th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng, TikTok kh\u00f4ng cho bi\u1ebft th\u1eddi gian c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ed5i l\u1ea1i ng\u00e0y sinh. B\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ki\u1ec3m tra \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3, n\u1ebfu n\u00fat \u201cNg\u00e0y sinh\u201d ch\u01b0a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u1edf l\u1ea1i th\u00ec c\u1ea7n ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c ch\u1edd.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T6tJdQY6doWkyhxM5NFlFYpPgmb\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-JKDMdEEh6o9ck7xbwGNlj5Djgbd\"><strong>5. Nh\u1eefng c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p v\u1ec1 th\u00f4ng tin ng\u00e0y th\u00e1ng n\u0103m sinh tr\u00ean TikTok<\/strong><\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4817\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4817\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4817\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-1.png\" alt=\"C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p v\u1ec1 th\u00f4ng tin ng\u00e0y th\u00e1ng n\u0103m sinh tr\u00ean TikTok\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/3-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4817\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p v\u1ec1 th\u00f4ng tin ng\u00e0y th\u00e1ng n\u0103m sinh tr\u00ean TikTok<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MsG4dO5MwoP8ONxVhHel7qF6g5g\"><strong>1. T\u00f4i kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i ng\u00e0y sinh, ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0m sao?<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NKDNdPLVsoEAu6xbeZUlqDcsgze\">N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n th\u1ea5y th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o \u201cKh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i ng\u00e0y sinh\u201d, t\u1ee9c l\u00e0 b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 ch\u1ec9nh g\u1ea7n \u0111\u00e2y. TikTok hi\u1ec7n kh\u00f4ng cho ph\u00e9p ch\u1ec9nh li\u00ean t\u1ee5c v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 c\u00e1ch can thi\u1ec7p tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp. B\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ee3i h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng t\u1ef1 m\u1edf l\u1ea1i quy\u1ec1n ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AzNYdkzZ9o2J6mxQOUBl9ysxgVd\"><strong>2. T\u00f4i c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i ng\u00e0y sinh tr\u00ean TikTok bao nhi\u00eau l\u1ea7n?<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AHrIdsPyKoPCiqxtPjilvTrzg5g\">B\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thay \u0111\u1ed5i ng\u00e0y sinh m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n trong m\u1ed9t kho\u1ea3ng th\u1eddi gian nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ecbnh. Sau khi \u0111\u1ed5i, h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng s\u1ebd kh\u00f3a t\u00ednh n\u0103ng n\u00e0y trong m\u1ed9t th\u1eddi gian kh\u00f4ng x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n ch\u1edd \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda ti\u1ebfp.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GFVnd2zimoCEy9xPHM6l8ySHgPc\"><strong>3. V\u00ec sao t\u00f4i kh\u00f4ng xem \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c livestream hay b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn video?<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MmhidJQ0xo4mpyxcQfHl8mKugVv\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 do b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 nh\u1eadp ng\u00e0y sinh cho th\u1ea5y b\u1ea1n d\u01b0\u1edbi 18 tu\u1ed5i. TikTok gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n nhi\u1ec1u t\u00ednh n\u0103ng nh\u01b0 livestream, b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn, nh\u1eafn tin&#8230; \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng ch\u01b0a \u0111\u1ee7 tu\u1ed5i.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hs4ld1bTno09E0xayiZlQPcNgvb\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HXjcdxwmZoWKXWx2UonlRnRagXf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DbKTdkhWYoO6U4xrDw5lJAneg7d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G1uLdZxz9o0PTAxKBZRllhjTgUd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O9KWdu2pTo6MwFxvXFgltbDcgse\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B0WcdXMVaocQq6xInUDlXkDrgNc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Thay \u0111\u1ed5i ng\u00e0y th\u00e1ng n\u0103m sinh tr\u00ean TikTok l\u00e0 thao t\u00e1c t\u01b0\u1edfng ch\u1eebng \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n nh\u01b0ng l\u1ea1i \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng l\u1edbn \u0111\u1ebfn quy\u1ec1n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c t\u00ednh n\u0103ng quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u01b0 livestream, nh\u1eafn tin hay truy c\u1eadp TikTok Shop. V\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n hay th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, n\u1ebfu c\u1ea7n t\u1ed1i \u01b0u to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n t\u1eeb thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":5044,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4975","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4975","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4975"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4975\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5214,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4975\/revisions\/5214"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/l